cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the VERA-AI Alert software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "VERA-AI Alert: Self-updating detection of coordinated sharing behaviour on Facebook"
abstract: >
  VERA-AI Alert is a self-updating detection workflow for coordinated
  sharing behaviour on Facebook. It wraps existing detection engines
  (CLSB, CMSB, CITSB) inside a recursive monitoring loop that expands
  the watched account list as new coordinated accounts are discovered.
